Z||000000||wallmic||03-05-2000||06:20 PM||||My 85GT wipers started to operate erratic about a month ago.  When operating in delay mode, periodically they would start a cycle then immediately stop.  Turning them off then on or turing to fast would reset the wipers allowing another 8 to 10 cycles.  It kept on deteriorating and now they only operate in fast.  I removed the motor and inspected and cleaned the relay contacts on the pc board (quite pitted) and the "park" contacts inside the motor case.  Neither helped!<P>Any suggestions?  Does someone have a schematic?||||reg||5
